{"id": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN", "offset": 3369, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 3188, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN", "offset": 3374, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f144f5418160f0f12f2ff0c0f387f15af186f27cf0f1f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "가볍～게//비틀어드릴게요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "軽～く//ひねってあげますぅ！", "pointer_offset": 3192, "unit": "dialogue:09134c54c23ddd5b", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN", "offset": 4106, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f0bcf0d7f0b9f147f15781432f2ff99cf64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf0a8f168f0ef816081b8", "baseline_text": "이번 시합에서는，//내 패가//보너스 패라구요～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//あたしのパイが//ボーナスパイなんですよぅ！", "pointer_offset": 3196, "unit": "dialogue:0fb62b08d8991584", "prior_review": "말투 점검"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN", "offset": 3462, "capacity": 66, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff957f0b2f299f0b2f3b6f0b8f0cf816081442f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e72f2ff1e1fbc1f1e2f1d5f0ef816081b8", "baseline_text": "이번 주제는 이것이랍니다～．//이 중에서，어느 한 세트를//맞춰 주세요～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題はこれですぅ。//この中の、どれか１組を//そろえてくださいねぇ∈", "pointer_offset": 3200, "unit": "dialogue:0126ec5fd7ab559d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN", "offset": 3535, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f19cf944f5f3f0c7f0a8f168816081442f2ff2eaf0b2f2eaf0b281b8", "baseline_text": "내가 딜러라구～．//휘이휘이∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あたしが親ですよぅ。//ヒューヒュー∈", "pointer_offset": 3204, "unit": "dialogue:5ca7b50c90cb31de", "prior_review": "말투 점검"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN", "offset": 4151, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f0b9f0f12f2ff5f3f0c7f8e7f362fac6f186f27cf0f1f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨에게//딜러를 맡겨 드릴게요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さんに、//親をやらせてあげますぅ！", "pointer_offset": 3208, "unit": "dialogue:ba5ba1a91d426a2c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN", "offset": 3611, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f0b9f8f4f144f5418160f0f12f2ff6c4f9eaf186f27cf0f1f0eff0b58144", "baseline_text": "다음에도 가볍～게//눕혀 드릴게요오．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "つぎもかる～く//のしてあげますよぉ。", "pointer_offset": 3212, "unit": "dialogue:8a1a17de1d51423d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN", "offset": 3648, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f1bef0faf0e5f8e7f26af0e2f0a32f2ff1f7f36df8c8f0cff0a5f0cff0b8f7d1", "baseline_text": "여자애를 상대로//전력을 다하다니…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "女の子相手に//本気出すなんて……", "pointer_offset": 3216, "unit": "dialogue:aea87668fb504ffb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN", "offset": 3681, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3fb55f199f999fa64f94bf1e2f1d5f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "다음엔 살살 좀 해 주세요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次は手加減してくださぁい！", "pointer_offset": 3220, "unit": "dialogue:40c628548aee0d4b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN", "offset": 3708, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f48cf0e4f14b81b82f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247fa82f36ef1f7f8b6f3e2f16ff0aff0ef81b82f2ff2eaf0b2f2eaf0b2816081b8", "baseline_text": "굉장해∈//오오가미 씨랑 완전히 똑같아요∈//휘이휘이～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "スッゴーイ！//大神さんとぴったり一緒ですぅ！//ヒューヒュー∈", "pointer_offset": 3224, "unit": "dialogue:d3f0435061c77386", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN", "offset": 3769, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b5f25af2a9f0d2f944f3a1f259f8c8f16e", "baseline_text": "토너먼트가 끝났을 때", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝ち抜き戦が終わった時", "pointer_offset": 3228, "unit": "dialogue:bb0e5833a13689be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT14SIE_.SBN", "offset": 3792, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 3232, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
